OL,3,AWhat we know about Krakow mass shooting
OL,4,Aso far
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people have been killed
OL,7,Fand several others injured after a
OL,8,Fgunman opened fire in central Krakow,
OL,9,Fthe second largest city in Poland.
OL,10,FDetails are still emerging - here is
OL,11,Feverything we know so far.
OL,13,FThe attack began shortly before 15:00
OL,14,Flocal time (14:00 GMT) in Krakow's Main
OL,15,FMarket Square, the bustling central
OL,16,Fpoint of the city.
OL,18,FPolice said a man drove into the square
OL,19,Fbefore beginning to fire "at random
OL,20,Fpeople from his car".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
